  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grid-Connected Rooftop Solar Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO is to increase installed capacity of Grid-connected Rooftop Solar Photovoltaic (GRPV) and to strengthen the capacity of relevant institutions for GRPV. The Program Environmental Objective (PEO) is to achieve reductions in GHG emissions through the displacement of thermal energy with solar energy.</narrative>
  </description>
